levance to A350/B787 long-haul operations, especially ETOPS, fatigue, dispatch, MEL, navigation, and approach threats.','Review source updates and convert relevant items into the operational lessons database.','["Safety", "Operations", "Training", "Flight Operations", "Low", "supplementary_source"]',200,'2026-07-25 01:47:21.015579','2026-06-22 17:01:55.964012','2026-07-25 01:47:21.015579');
