ndings confirm them.','Screen for relevance to A350/B787 long-haul operations, especially ETOPS, fatigue, dispatch, MEL, navigation, and approach threats.','Check for new factual reports, classify severity, and extract operational lessons without assigning blame.','["ICAO", "Safety", "Global", "Accident / Incident", "Medium", "official_report_candidate"]',200,'2026-07-25 01:47:21.024287','2026-06-22 17:01:55.964012','2026-07-25 01:47:21.024287');
